{"resourceIdentifier":"3668","resourceName":"Jintudi Composting Project in Zhucheng City","description":"The project introduced a set of organic fertilizers production lines with an annual output of 32,500 tons to treat the manure from the chicken farms in Zhucheng City, Shandong Province. The purpose of the project activity is to avoid methane emissions through controlled aerobic treatment by composting of manure.\r\nIn absence of the project, all manure waste produced was left to decay in uncovered anaerobic lagoons, which is the most economic, viable and reasonable for livestock farm owners. The proposed project was designed to treat the chicken manure in Zhucheng City to produce organic fertilizer. The proposed project comprises of fermentation system and fertilizer production system, etc. It is estimated that approximately 98,000 tons of manure can be composted aerobically annually for this project.","location":{"latitude":36.053055,"longitude":119.442777},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-10-19","endExclusive":"2022-11-19","endInclusive":"2022-11-18"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3668"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhucheng Jintudi Organic Fertilizer Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"15589896865"},{"type":"string","value":"wanglei_jintudi@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"58860"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D.,AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"str